    <briefdescription>
<para>Extension for a TLM payload. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides an extension for a TLM payload. It holds a shared pointer to another TLM payload.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This extension is unmanaged and must be freed automatically. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
